# .secrets.allow — regex allow-list for scan-secrets.sh
#
# Each line is a regex; matches against the FULL line containing a secret
# pattern. Use ONLY for intentional, non-sensitive fixtures (test values,
# schema field names, doc examples). Real secrets must never be allow-listed.
#
